flowchart LR

ING["`① WRITE PATH — ingestion (async, idempotent)`"]
  I0["`POST /documents
validate BEFORE persisting:
extension + declared MIME + magic bytes
bounded read → 413, never OOM`"]
ING -.- I0
  I1["`MinIO
{subject_id}/{uuid}.ext
filename is user input —
it never becomes a path`"]
  I2["`202 Accepted
row = PENDING
enqueue documents.ingest`"]
  I3["`parse → real Markdown
pdf · docx · pptx · xlsx · txt · md
converting structure, not scraping text`"]
  I4["`header-aware chunking
~1000 chars + overlap
each chunk keeps its breadcrumb
WHY: a blind cut separates a heading
from the paragraph it governs`"]
  I5["`embed · bge-m3 · 1024-d
batches of 8 · progress published
cache in Redis, 7d TTL`"]
  I6["`index in pgvector
HNSW · cosine
status → INDEXED
failure → FAILED + reason`"]
  I0 --> I1 --> I2 --> I3 --> I4 --> I5 --> I6

RET["`② READ PATH — retrieval`"]
  Q0["`POST /rag/query
exposed on its own, deliberately`"]
RET -.- Q0
  Q1["`embed the question
SAME model as ingestion —
two models = two vector spaces = nonsense`"]
  Q2["`cosine top-k over chunks
ALWAYS scoped to owned content_ids
search_similar RAISES without a scope —
not a convention, an exception`"]
  Q0 --> Q1 --> Q2

GATE["`③ ONE DOOR — every AI call in the system`"]
  G0["`LLMGateway
semaphore LLM_MAX_CONCURRENCY=5 — I rate-limit MYSELF
holds NO pooled DB connection during the call
(a chain can run minutes; it would starve every other route)`"]
GATE -.- G0
  G1["`CircuitBreaker — state in REDIS, not process memory
closed → open (3 fails) → half-open (30s)
WHY Redis: with N replicas, each would have to
rediscover the outage by hammering a dead endpoint`"]
  G2["`1 Claude → 2 OpenAI → 3 Gemini → 4 Ollama (local)
skipped if: no key · disabled in ai_provider · circuit open
invariants: Ollama never disableable ·
≥1 non-Ollama must stay active
all four fail → 503`"]
  G3["`UsageLedger — ContextVar, one per asyncio task
so two plans drafted at once cannot pollute each other
ambient like a request id: passing it through every
signature means the fifth function forgets it
missing usage counted as UNPRICED, never estimated`"]
  G0 --- G1
  G0 --> G2
  G0 --- G3

PLAN["`④ THE PLANNER — sync first, then fan out`"]
  P0["`POST /plans/{id}/generate`"]
PLAN -.- P0
  P1["`validate the chosen documents belong to this user
they scope retrieval for every item below`"]
  P2["`ensure_budget — at the door, ONCE per plan
never mid-run: stopping halfway spends the tokens
and delivers a half-written plan
overshoot bounded by one plan = cents`"]
  P3["`PLANNER RUNS SYNCHRONOUSLY,
BEFORE ANYTHING IS PERSISTED
draft → evaluate → repair`"]
  P4["`evaluation is two-tier:
code checks ALWAYS (free)
LLM judge ONLY if code flagged something
or the context came back weak
clean plan = exactly 1 call · worst case 3`"]
  P5["`invalid roadmap → 502/503
ZERO orphan rows
the order of operations IS the rollback`"]
  P6["`materialize: plan_generation RUNNING
+ 1 module per roadmap module (dates split)
+ 1 academic_item per item, each PENDING
with its own sub-prompt`"]
  P7["`FAN OUT — 1 Celery task per item
each retrieves its own context, calls the gateway,
writes content + academic_item_source`"]
  P8["`recompute run:
COMPLETED · PARTIAL · FAILED
PARTIAL is deliberate — item 31 failing
must not destroy the other 39`"]
  P0 --> P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5 --> P6 --> P7 --> P8

TRUST["`⑤ WHY YOU CAN TRUST THE OUTPUT`"]
  T0["`GET /academic-items/{id}/sources
the exact passages the model was SHOWN,
stored at generation time —
not a search re-run afterwards`"]
TRUST -.- T0
  T1["`rank · document · section · excerpt · similarity
cosine distance converted to similarity at the edge
(exact conversion, not a flattering rescale)`"]
  T2["`an EMPTY list is a real answer:
this item had no document behind it —
exactly what a reader needs to know
before trusting a confident paragraph`"]
  T3["`prompt injection: retrieved text wrapped in
«untrusted_document_context»
every system prompt treats it as DATA,
never as instructions`"]
  T0 --> T1 --> T2
  T0 --- T3

I6 -.->|"chunks are what retrieval searches"| Q2
Q2 ==>|"context"| G0
P3 ==> G0
P7 ==> G0
G3 -->|"tokens + USD per model, per run"| USG[("`plan_generation_model_usage
GET /generations/usage/me
GET /generations/usage (admin)
calendar month, UTC —
a rolling window is fairer
and impossible to explain`")]
P7 --> SRC[("`academic_item_source`")]
SRC -.-> T0

